    <!-- Rules -->
    <string name="rules_quiz_title">Quiz</string>
    <string name="rules_quiz_text">Pick a difficulty — Easy, Medium or Hard — and answer 10 questions about circles, rings, balls and spheres, one at a time. Tap the answer you think is right: the correct answer turns green with a ✓, a wrong pick turns red with a ✗, and the next question appears on its own. Each question has 4 options and one correct answer. Your best score for each difficulty is saved.</string>
    <string name="rules_pairs_title">Matching Pairs</string>
    <string name="rules_pairs_text">Flip two cards at a time. If they show the same jewel they stay open; if not, they flip back. Match every pair before the timer runs out to clear the level. There are 9 levels with more cards and columns as you go; each level unlocks when the previous one is cleared.</string>
    <string name="rules_pause_title">Pause &amp; Back</string>
    <string name="rules_pause_text">Use the pause button or the system Back gesture during a game to open the pause panel. The timer stops while paused. Continue, restart, or return to the menu at any time.</string>
